Controllers ..> VOs
Services --> RuntimeModelManager
MateRuntimeModelManager ..|> RuntimeModelManager
Services --> AgentDirectorySnapshotDTO : acquire
MateRuntimeModelManager --> AgentDirectorySnapshotDTO
MateRuntimeModelManager -[norank,dashed]-> Model
Services -down-> AgentLoop : prepare / run
AgentLoop -[norank]-> Model
