AiProviderRegistry o-- "0..*" AiProvider
CampusClawAiService -down-> ApiProviderRegistry : API fallback
ApiProviderRegistry o-- "0..*" ApiProvider
CampusClawAiService -[norank]-> ModelRegistry
ModelRegistry o-- "0..*" Model
CampusMateProvider .up.|> AiProvider
CampusMateProvider *-- "1" MateChatRequestMapper
CampusMateProvider *-- "1" WebClient
CampusMateProvider --> Config
CampusMateProvider ..> MateChatSseParser : create
CampusMateProvider ..> AssistantMessageEventStream : create / return
MateChatSseParser --> AssistantMessageEventStream : emit
AgentLoop -[norank]-> AssistantMessageEventStream : consume
WebClient --> Chat : POST / SSE
WebClient -[norank]-> MateChatSseParser : chunks

Controllers -[hidden]down-> Services
VOs -[hidden]down-> Services
Services -[hidden]down-> CampusClawAiService
CampusClawAiService -[hidden]down-> CampusMateProvider
MateChatRequestMapper -[hidden]right-> WebClient
